# DOCKER_HUB_USERNAME=
# DOCKER_HUB_PASSWORD=
# =============================================================================

# =============================================================================
# SECURITY NOTES
# =============================================================================
# 1. NEVER commit .env file to git (already in .gitignore)
# 2. Use strong random keys (at least 32 characters)
# 3. Different keys for each service (don't reuse)
# 4. Store backup of .env in secure password manager
# 5. Rotate keys quarterly for production systems
# 6. Private network IP (10.10.0.2) is already secure - no encryption needed
# =============================================================================

# =============================================================================
# PRIVATE NETWORK ARCHITECTURE
# =============================================================================
# VPS1 (salem-nexus):  10.10.0.2 (Postgres, Directus, etc.)
# VPS2 (salem-forge):  10.10.0.3 (This VPS - LiteLLM, Chroma, etc.)
# VPS3 (salem-platform): 10.10.0.4 (MCP Platform)
#
# All cross-VPS database connections use private IPs (10.10.0.x)
# Benefits:
# - Free bandwidth (no Hetzner egress charges)
# - Better security (traffic never leaves Hetzner network)
# - Lower latency (~0.5ms vs 2-5ms)
# - No firewall rules needed (private network isolated)
# =============================================================================
